      "content": "i've already tried the tea and ice packs and they do nothing for this pain. i am really desperate here. i looked at the bottle and it says max 4000mg a day but i haven't even taken anything today because i'm scared to mess up. if i just took 3000mg right now once to knock it out, would that be okay? i really just need to get through the night without crying from the pain.",
